- Coll de Llastarri (7.4 km) 
.........................................', '{"en":"This moderate loop trail starts from the village of Adons, where parking is available. The route ascends to Tossal Gros (Serra de Sant Gervàs), a peak of 1546 meters, offering a rewarding climb through the Ribagorça landscape.\n\nThe trail passes through Coll de Llastarri and Coll de Sant Roc, connecting with the GR 3 for the return leg. The path is well-defined and suitable for hikers looking for a solid day out without extreme technical challenges.\n\nCovering 13.1 km with 633m of elevation gain, this route provides a good balance of distance and ascent, making it a suitable option for moderately fit hikers.","ca":"Aquesta ruta circular moderada comença des del poble d''Adons, on hi ha aparcament disponible. La ruta ascendeix al Tossal Gros (Serra de Sant Gervàs), un cim de 1546 metres, oferint una pujada gratificant a través del paisatge de la Ribagorça.\n\nEl camí passa pel Coll de Llastarri i el Coll de Sant Roc, connectant amb el GR 3 per al tram de tornada. El sender està ben definit i és adequat per a excursionistes que busquen una bona jornada sense reptes tècnics extrems.\n\nAmb 13,1 km i 633m de desnivell positiu, aquesta ruta ofereix un bon equilibri de distància i ascens, sent una opció adequada per a excursionistes amb una condició física moderada.","es":"Esta ruta circular moderada comienza desde el pueblo de Adons, donde hay aparcamiento disponible. La ruta asciende al Tossal Gros (Serra de Sant Gervàs), una cima de 1546 metros, ofreciendo una subida gratificante a través del paisaje de la Ribagorça.\n\nEl sendero pasa por el Coll de Llastarri y el Coll de Sant Roc, conectando con el GR 3 para el tramo de regreso. El camino está bien definido y es adecuado para excursionistas que buscan una buena jornada sin desafíos técnicos extremos.\n\nCon 13,1 km y 633m de desnivel positivo, esta ruta ofrece un buen equilibrio de distancia y ascenso, siendo una opción adecuada para excursionistas con una condición física moderada."}'::jsonb, 'Willy Fogg', 13148, 633, 633, 1658, 1296, 'moderate', 'loop', NULL, 22740, 2739, '2023-03-16', '2023-02', '[{"lat":42.332827,"lng":0.828347,"ele":1333.9},{"lat":42.332827,"lng":0.828348,"ele":1333.9},{"lat":42.332828,"lng":0.828348,"ele":1333.9},{"lat":42.332832,"lng":0.828339,"ele":1333.9},{"lat":42.332851,"lng":0.828316,"ele":1333.9},{"lat":42.332875,"lng":0.828258,"ele":1333.9},{"lat":42.332858,"lng":0.828225,"ele":1333.9},{"lat":42.332828,"lng":0.828153,"ele":1332.5},{"lat":42.332804,"lng":0.828103,"ele":1332.5},{"lat":42.332788,"lng":0.828086,"ele":1332.5},{"lat":42.332783,"lng":0.828083,"ele":1332},{"lat":42.332778,"lng":0.828042,"ele":1331},{"lat":42.332757,"lng":0.828004,"ele":1329.6},{"lat":42.332752,"lng":0.827987,"ele":1329.6},{"lat":42.332753,"lng":0.827985,"ele":1329.6},{"lat":42.332756,"lng":0.827966,"ele":1329.6},{"lat":42.332747,"lng":0.827961,"ele":1329.6},{"lat":42.33277,"lng":0.827963,"ele":1329.1},{"lat":42.332724,"lng":0.827961,"ele":1328.6},{"lat":42.332674,"lng":0.82791,"ele":1328.6},{"lat":42.332622,"lng":0.827836,"ele":1327.7},{"lat":42.332563,"lng":0.827753,"ele":1327.2},{"lat":42.332511,"lng":0.827644,"ele":1325.3},{"lat":42.332492,"lng":0.827523,"ele":1326.2},{"lat":42.33247,"lng":0.82749,"ele":1325.3},{"lat":42.332408,"lng":0.827427,"ele":1325.3},{"lat":42.332372,"lng":0.82739,"ele":1324.3},{"lat":42.332344,"lng":0.827359,"ele":1324.3},{"lat":42.332235,"lng":0.827282,"ele":1322.4},{"lat":42.332143,"lng":0.827226,"ele":1321.4},{"lat":42.332075,"lng":0.827165,"ele":1320.9},{"lat":42.332062,"lng":0.827137,"ele":1320.5},{"lat":42.332037,"lng":0.827087,"ele":1319.5},{"lat":42.332,"lng":0.826958,"ele":1319},{"lat":42.331989,"lng":0.826872,"ele":1317.1},{"lat":42.331955,"lng":0.82674,"ele":1316.1},{"lat":42.331939,"lng":0.826652,"ele":1314.2},{"lat":42.331917,"lng":0.826597,"ele":1313.7},{"lat":42.331851,"lng":0.826486,"ele":1312.8},{"lat":42.331803,"lng":0.826381,"ele":1311.8},{"lat":42.331781,"lng":0.826266,"el