('wikiloc', '13125873', 'https://www.wikiloc.com/hiking-trails/muntanya-i-ermita-de-santa-fe-1-208-m-100-cims-13125873', 'Santa Fe Mountain and Hermitage 1,208 m - 100 Peaks', '{"en":"Short loop from Organyà","ca":"Circular curta des d''Organyà","es":"Circular corta desde Organyà"}'::jsonb, 'Muntanya i ermita de Santa Fe 1.208 m - 100 cims Hiking trail in Organyà, Catalunya (España). Download its GPS track and follow the itinerary on a map. Curta i ben senyalitzada ruta que ens portarà al cim de la Muntanya de Santa Fe, amb la seva ermita, a 1.208 m. on gaudirem d''unes magnífiques vistes panoràmiques vers la vall del Segre amb els pobles d''Organyà, Fígols, Coll de Nargó, etc.', '{"en":"This easy 7.4 km loop offers a well-marked ascent to the summit of Santa Fe Mountain and its hermitage at 1,208 m. The route is relatively short, making it suitable for a quick outing.\n\nFrom the summit, hikers can enjoy extensive panoramic views over the Segre valley, including the towns of Organyà, Fígols, and Coll de Nargó. The trail provides a direct and accessible way to reach this prominent peak.","ca":"Aquesta ruta circular fàcil de 7.4 km ofereix un ascens ben senyalitzat al cim de la Muntanya de Santa Fe i la seva ermita a 1.208 m. La ruta és relativament curta, adequada per a una sortida ràpida.\n\nDes del cim, els excursionistes poden gaudir d''extenses vistes panoràmiques sobre la vall del Segre, incloent els pobles d''Organyà, Fígols i Coll de Nargó. El sender proporciona una manera directa i accessible d''arribar a aquest pic destacat.","es":"Esta ruta circular fácil de 7.4 km ofrece un ascenso bien señalizado a la cima de la Montaña de Santa Fe y su ermita a 1.208 m. La ruta es relativamente corta, adecuada para una salida rápida.\n\nDesde la cima, los excursionistas pueden disfrutar de extensas vistas panorámicas sobre el valle del Segre, incluyendo los pueblos de Organyà, Fígols y Coll de Nargó. El sendero proporciona una manera directa y accesible de llegar a este pico destacado."}'::jsonb, 'Imperdibles', 7355, 611, 611, 1202, 586, 'easy', 'loop', NULL, 16800, 798, '2016-04-28', '2016-03', '[{"lat":42.213982,"lng":1.32402,"ele":585.9},{"lat":42.213978,"lng":1.324006,"ele":586},{"lat":42.213992,"lng":1.323988,"ele":586.2},{"lat":42.214105,"lng":1.323758,"ele":588.3},{"lat":42.214182,"lng":1.323577,"ele":590.3},{"lat":42.214242,"lng":1.323385,"ele":591.8},{"lat":42.214317,"lng":1.323271,"ele":593},{"lat":42.214443,"lng":1.323093,"ele":594.7},{"lat":42.2145,"lng":1.323044,"ele":594.9},{"lat":42.214521,"lng":1.322991,"ele":595.3},{"lat":42.214523,"lng":1.323009,"ele":595.1},{"lat":42.214559,"lng":1.322869,"ele":596.2},{"lat":42.214563,"lng":1.322598,"ele":597.6},{"lat":42.214633,"lng":1.322372,"ele":599.2},{"lat":42.214662,"lng":1.322092,"ele":601.3},{"lat":42.214669,"lng":1.321923,"ele":602},{"lat":42.214685,"lng":1.321754,"ele":603.2},{"lat":42.21471,"lng":1.32149,"ele":605.2},{"lat":42.214729,"lng":1.321269,"ele":606.9},{"lat":42.214713,"lng":1.321003,"ele":608.7},{"lat":42.214708,"lng":1.320926,"ele":609.3},{"lat":42.214596,"lng":1.320709,"ele":610.7},{"lat":42.214493,"lng":1.320458,"ele":612.3},{"lat":42.214436,"lng":1.320261,"ele":614.1},{"lat":42.214402,"lng":1.320155,"ele":615.1},{"lat":42.214357,"lng":1.319978,"ele":616.6},{"lat":42.214344,"lng":1.319882,"ele":617.3},{"lat":42.21436,"lng":1.319838,"ele":617.7},{"lat":42.21438,"lng":1.319699,"ele":619},{"lat":42.214461,"lng":1.319433,"ele":621.1},{"lat":42.214495,"lng":1.319288,"ele":622.3},{"lat":42.214516,"lng":1.31908,"ele":624.1},{"lat":42.214501,"lng":1.318858,"ele":626.2},{"lat":42.214472,"lng":1.318713,"ele":627.3},{"lat":42.214461,"lng":1.318676,"ele":627.5},{"lat":42.21447,"lng":1.318625,"ele":627.9},{"lat":42.214502,"lng":1.318415,"ele":630.1},{"lat":42.214501,"lng":1.318401,"ele":630.3},{"lat":42.2145,"lng":1.318226,"ele":631.8},{"lat":42.21452,"lng":1.318095,"ele":632.7},{"lat":42.214519,"lng":1.318043,"ele":633.1},{"lat":42.214502,"lng":1.317823,"ele":635.3}