('wikiloc', '133142497', 'https://www.wikiloc.com/hiking-trails/serrat-de-carrasquers-tossal-de-torrades-i-poble-vell-de-galleuda-des-de-la-collada-del-calco-133142497', 'Serrat de Carrasquers, Tossal de Torrades, and the Old Village of Galleuda from Collada del Calço', '{"en":"Loop via Tossal de Torrades and Galleuda","ca":"Circular per Tossal de Torrades i Galleuda","es":"Circular por Tossal de Torrades y Galleuda"}'::jsonb, 'Serrat de Carrasquers, Tossal de Torrades i Poble Vell de Galleuda des de la Collada del Calço Hiking trail in Boixols, Catalunya (España). Download its GPS track and follow the itinerary on a map. Accés: Collada del Calçó, a la Pagatera. 
 
Ruta al Pallars Jussà per la Serra de Porredon i Carrasquers, del poble de Galleuda, només indicar algun tram aventurer, però no gaire esbrossat a la baixada el Serrat de Carrasquers. 
Collada del Calçot, Tossal de les Torrades, Serrat de Carrasquers (�� cims 1429 m), Poble Vell de Galleuda, Coll de Caborriu, Mas Colladetes, Tossal Negre i retorn a la Collada del Calçó. 
Sortim de la Collada del Calçó, tot endinsar-nos al bosc i seguint per la carena a l''avantcim i Tossal de Torrades, ara devallem sense corriol a la pista, que d"aviat deixem per agafar el cami del Cap de la Serra que ens durà al Serrat de Carrasquers (�� cims 1429 m), seguim per la cinglera al mirador i retornem per devallar sense corriol però no gaire esbrossat, fins una esplanada aòn seguim un corriol/camí que ens durà a Sant Marc i Poble Vell de Galleuda, tot vorejant-lo a dalt del turó. Seguim al Coll de Caborriu, Mas Colladetes, per fer un anada i tornada al Tossal Negre, seguim al camí de Caborriu que ens retornarà a la Collada del Calçó', '{"en":"This moderate 13.3 km loop starts at Collada del Calçó, accessible via the Pagatera road. The route explores the Serra de Porredon and Carrasquers, visiting the Tossal de Torrades and the Serrat de Carrasquers summit (1429 m).\n\nThe trail involves some adventurous, less-cleared sections, particularly on the descent from Serrat de Carrasquers. It continues to the old village of Galleuda, Coll de Caborriu, and Mas Colladetes, with an out-and-back to Tossal Negre before returning to the start.","ca":"Aquesta ruta circular moderada de 13,3 km comença a la Collada del Calçó, accessible per la carretera de la Pagatera. La ruta explora la Serra de Porredon i Carrasquers, visitant el Tossal de Torrades i el cim del Serrat de Carrasquers (1429 m).\n\nEl camí inclou alguns trams aventurers i menys desbrossats, especialment a la baixada del Serrat de Carrasquers. Continua cap al Poble Vell de Galleuda, el Coll de Caborriu i Mas Colladetes, amb una anada i tornada al Tossal Negre abans de retornar al punt d''inici.","es":"Esta ruta circular moderada de 13,3 km comienza en la Collada del Calçó, accesible por la carretera de la Pagatera. La ruta explora la Serra de Porredon y Carrasquers, visitando el Tossal de Torrades y la cima del Serrat de Carrasquers (1429 m).\n\nEl sendero incluye algunos tramos aventureros y menos desbrozados, especialmente en el descenso del Serrat de Carrasquers. Continúa hacia el Pueblo Viejo de Galleuda, el Coll de Caborriu y Mas Colladetes, con una ida y vuelta al Tossal Negre antes de regresar al punto de inicio."}'::jsonb, 'Jordi Vallès', 13277, 538, 538, 1442, 1140, 'moderate', 'loop', 9960, 11880, 2274, '2023-04-28', '2023-03', '[{"lat":42.159371,"lng":1.189571,"ele":1276.6},{"lat":42.159336,"lng":1.18962,"ele":1276.6},{"lat":42.159309,"lng":1.189671,"ele":1276.6},{"lat":42.159302,"lng":1.189746,"ele":1277},{"lat":42.159304,"lng":1.189811,"ele":1277.4},{"lat":42.159315,"lng":1.189871,"ele":1277.9},{"lat":42.159267,"lng":1.189898,"ele":1278.2},{"lat":42.159222,"lng":1.189876,"ele":1278.6},{"lat":42.159177,"lng":1.189863,"ele":1278.9},{"lat":42.159124,"lng":1.189867,"ele":1279.5},{"lat":42.159079,"lng":1.189877,"ele":1279.8},{"lat":42.159034,"lng":1.189871,"ele":1280.1},{"lat":42.158998,"lng":1.189835,"ele":1280.8},{"lat":42.158948,"lng":1.189796,"ele":1281.8},{"lat":42.158897,"lng":1.189776,"ele":1282.1},{"lat":42.158853,"lng":1.189747,"ele":1283},{"lat":42.158806,"lng":1.189728,"ele":1284.6},{"lat":42.158757,"lng":1.18971,"ele":1285.3},{"lat":42.158737,"lng":1.189653,"ele":1286.4},{"lat":42.158704,"lng":1.189596,"ele":1288},{"lat":42.158661,"lng":1.189552,"ele":1289.5},{"lat":42.158621,"lng":1.18951,"ele":1290.1},{"lat":42.158576,"lng":1.189478,"ele":1290.5},{"lat":42.158529,"lng":1.189464,"ele":1291.1},{"lat":42.15848,"lng":1.189442,"ele":1291.5},{"lat":42.158448,"lng":1.189397,"ele":1291.9},{"lat":42.158411,"lng":1.189346,"ele":1292.3},{"lat":42.158371,"lng":1.189312,"ele":1293},{"lat":42.158329,"lng":1.189279,"ele":1293.8},{"lat":42.15828,"lng":1.189256,"ele":1294.7},{"lat":42.158237,"lng":1.189237,"ele":1295.1},{"lat":42.158186,"lng":1.189234,"ele":1296.3},{"lat":42.158139,"lng":1.189222,"ele":1297.8},{"lat":42.158092,"lng":1.189201,"ele":1301.2},{"lat":42.15805,"lng":1.189167,"ele":1303.7},{"lat":42.158003,"lng":1.189144,"ele":1304.8},{"lat":42.157988,