-”Muntanya i Ermita de St Quiri per Bellpui, Malgrat, Congost de Nyus, Miravall i Carena de Roques Roges des de Noves de Segre” 
es.wikiloc.com/rutas-senderismo/muntanya-i-ermita-de-st-quiri-per-bellpui-malgrat-congost-de-nyus-miravall-i-carena-de-roques-roges-64319052', '{"en":"This demanding 24 km loop from Noves de Segre ascends Cap de Pla Redon, traversing the shady side of Noves Forest before a long traverse through pines and moss, crossing scree slopes to reach the ancient Grau de la Cobertrada. The path then follows a sometimes indistinct ridge, marked with cairns, to Pla de Sarri.\n\nFrom Pla de Sarri, an intermittent path leads to Coll d''Eres, continuing through black pine forests and alpine meadows. The route includes detours to excellent viewpoints like Salt dels Gossos before reaching the grassy summit of Cap de Pla Redon. The descent follows a grassy track through the plains of Bordes d''Ares, making it a long and varied day with 1338m of elevation gain.","ca":"Aquesta exigent ruta circular de 24 km des de Noves de Segre puja al Cap de Pla Redon, travessant la cara obaga del Bosc de Noves abans d''una llarga travessa entre pins i molsa, creuant tarteres fins a l''antic Grau de la Cobertrada. El camí segueix una carena a trams indefinida, marcada amb fites, fins al Pla de Sarri.\n\nDes del Pla de Sarri, un sender intermitent porta al Coll d''Eres, continuant per boscos de pi negre i prats alpins. La ruta inclou desviaments a excel·lents miradors com el Salt dels Gossos abans d''arribar al cim herbós del Cap de Pla Redon. El descens segueix una pista herbosa pels plans de les Bordes d''Ares, sent una jornada llarga i variada amb 1338m de desnivell positiu.","es":"Esta exigente ruta circular de 24 km desde Noves de Segre asciende al Cap de Pla Redon, atravesando la cara umbría del Bosque de Noves antes de una larga travesía entre pinos y musgo, cruzando tarteras hasta el antiguo Grau de la Cobertrada. El camino sigue una cresta a tramos indefinida, marcada con hitos, hasta el Pla de Sarri.\n\nDesde el Pla de Sarri, un sendero intermitente lleva al Coll d''Eres, continuando por bosques de pino negro y prados alpinos. La ruta incluye desvíos a excelentes miradores como el Salt dels Gossos antes de llegar a la cima herbosa del Cap de Pla Redon. El descenso sigue una pista herbosa por los llanos de las Bordes d''Ares, siendo una jornada larga y variada con 1338m de desnivel positivo."}'::jsonb, 'Aventura''t', 24028, 1338, 1338, 1845, 608, 'moderate', 'loop', NULL, 28500, 1784, '2023-05-27', '2023-04', '[{"lat":42.293647,"lng":1.345615,"ele":616.8},{"lat":42.29361,"lng":1.34565,"ele":616.7},{"lat":42.293504,"lng":1.34561,"ele":616.5},{"lat":42.293421,"lng":1.345534,"ele":616.5},{"lat":42.293206,"lng":1.345418,"ele":616.8},{"lat":42.293153,"lng":1.345455,"ele":616.2},{"lat":42.293069,"lng":1.345662,"ele":614.7},{"lat":42.292975,"lng":1.34591,"ele":613.9},{"lat":42.292773,"lng":1.346159,"ele":613.2},{"lat":42.292689,"lng":1.346189,"ele":612.9},{"lat":42.292562,"lng":1.346258,"ele":612.3},{"lat":42.292323,"lng":1.346397,"ele":611.4},{"lat":42.292161,"lng":1.346457,"ele":610.6},{"lat":42.292078,"lng":1.346425,"ele":610},{"lat":42.291852,"lng":1.346354,"ele":609.1},{"lat":42.291594,"lng":1.346474,"ele":608.7},{"lat":42.291422,"lng":1.346591,"ele":608.1},{"lat":42.291256,"lng":1.346685,"ele":608.4},{"lat":42.291139,"lng":1.346661,"ele":609},{"lat":42.291053,"lng":1.346646,"ele":611.6},{"lat":42.291008,"lng":1.346464,"ele":616.6},{"lat":42.29099,"lng":1.346338,"ele":619.2},{"lat":42.290899,"lng":1.346202,"ele":625.4},{"lat":42.29082,"lng":1.346099,"ele":630.9},{"lat":42.290828,"lng":1.345989,"ele":631.2},{"lat":42.290793,"lng":1.345915,"ele":633.9},{"lat":42.290735,"lng":1.345943,"ele":637.4},{"lat":42.290681,"lng":1.346021,"ele":640.3},{"lat":42.290642,"lng":1.34614,"ele":642.4},{"lat":42.290625,"lng":1.346249,"ele":643.6},{"lat":42.290595,"lng":1.346344,"ele":645.9},{"lat":42.290505,"lng":1.346406,"ele":651.1},{"lat":42.290432,"lng":1.346487,"ele":653.2},{"lat":42.29032,"lng":1.346548,"ele":657.2},{"lat":42.290257,"lng":1.34646,"ele":661.6},{"lat":42.2